        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew was forced to land on an unknown planet. Now it is your responsibility to create the order they need to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team struggles with hunger, energy, morale and health. Every decision you make shapes the future of the colony. You must bring order to the chaos and rebuild everything from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for resources during the day. Explore new areas. Build your production chain and improve the efficiency of your crew. At night prepare your defenses. The darkness of this planet is never friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the parts and energy cores needed to repair the damaged main ship. Upgrade your technology and expand the colony. Every new day can increase your chances of survival or bring a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that not everyone survives on this planet. With the right choices your crew still has a chance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Night Is a Test</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness falls safety is never guaranteed stay prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196740/extras/557a848d7d10afb6648a93960a477209.poster.avif?t=1779748628\" width=420 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4196740/extras/557a848d7d10afb6648a93960a477209.webm?t=1779748628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Colony</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your crew by building new structures and efficient production chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c